<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Scoundrels</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lovejoy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">One Simple Trick</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6sdbnMCqb1ptmgw0a6XP58</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">26 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Scoundrels Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All our friends have... have sponsors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the hope to attract a national brand</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sum your values up... on a postcard</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hide the long... the long words under stamps</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm praying for wisdom, a better physician</p><p ttm:agent="v1">While softly blaspheming in the brace position</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And every professional, checking the sensible</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Barely detectable, flawed by a scoundrel's design</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chorus - Will Gold, Joe Goldsmith</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I fall, oh, I tend to fall sometimes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Though I'm tall</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I can't access heaven if I try</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, I won't get to heaven in this life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I could lie awake, oh God, how I usеd to lie awake</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And listen to rеpetition</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In my dreams, I'm chased, well, at least when I dream them</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Not since my carbon emissions, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've taken to listless</p><p ttm:agent="v1">,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been preconditioned</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To misdiagnosing myself to remission</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We hunt down this villain, condemned to perdition</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Worn down by attrition and flawed by a scoundrel's design[Chorus - Will Gold, Joe Goldsmith]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I fall, oh, I tend to fall sometimes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Though I'm tall</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I can't access heaven if I try</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, I won't get to heaven in this life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fight! Fight! (Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fight! Fight! Fight! Fire! (Ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So what's it even mean</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To be accepted by the scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And judge your worth in magazines</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And lend your life to ketamine?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You know that)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I could see the woods if not for all these fucking trees</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And we're so hounded by a cure</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That's for a separate disease</p><p ttm:agent="v1">He lights the sparkler, prays it dies</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Another threat, he stays inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There's no more meaning to the highs</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There's only viewing platforms built to watch it burn</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm not sure if it's purpose anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I know this, despite my wish</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A scoundrel's all I'll ever</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(</p><p ttm:agent="v1">know</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p></div></body></tt>